      { n: "1.1", text: "The Vilij Limited (“The Vilij”, “we”, “us” or “our”) operates an online community and platform designed to support parents and carers of children with special educational needs and disabilities (“SEND”) through information, resources, community engagement and connections with independent Experts." },
