      {
        n: "1.4",
        text: "The purposes of this Safeguarding Policy are to:",
        items: [
          "set out The Vilij’s safeguarding principles and commitments;",
          "provide a framework for preventing and reducing the risk of harm arising through use of the Platform;",
          "explain the responsibilities of Users, Experts and persons acting on behalf of The Vilij;",
          "support the prompt recognition, reporting and appropriate management of Safeguarding Concerns;",
          "ensure that safeguarding decisions are made consistently, proportionately and with appropriate senior oversight;",
          "explain how safeguarding information will be recorded, stored and shared; and",
          "promote a culture in which concerns can be raised safely and are taken seriously.",
